From ba15db1a576dcdc8d51ba15bd069b9fd1f748d97 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Xiake Sun <xiake.sun@amd.com>
Date: Tue, 28 Jul 2026 01:55:35 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: Add opt-in FlyDSL paged decode for MiMo EAGLE
 verification

Adds an opt-in SGLANG_AITER_PA_DECODE_IMPL=flydsl path for MiMo-V2.5-Pro EAGLE target verification on gfx942.
Sink-free full-attention layers using the exact qlen-4, 16Q/1KV, head-192, page-64, BF16/FP8 vectorized-5D shape are
ispatched to FlyDSL, while SWA/sink layers and ordinary decode remain on AITER.

Signed-off-by: Xiake Sun <xiake.sun@amd.com>
---
